within Pharmacolibrary.Drugs.N_NervousSystem.N02A_Opioids.N02AA11_Oxymorphone;
model Oxymorphone_Sadiq2013_PD_tfl
  "emax exposure-response sweep — Sadiq_2013 :: TFL (tail-flick latency)"
  extends Pharmacolibrary.Pharmacodynamic.SigmoidEmaxSweep(
    E0 = 5.27,      // [s; s × 1]
    Emax = 55.1,  // [s; s × 1]
    EC50 = 6.26e-05,  // [kg/m3; ng/mL × 1e-06]
    gamma = 1,
    exposure_per_s = 1e-06);   // 1 ng/mL per second
  // defaulted: gamma
  annotation(experiment(StartTime = 0, StopTime = 630, Interval = 1.26),
    Documentation(info = "<html><body><h4>Oxymorphone_Sadiq2013_PD_tfl</h4><p>The steady-state exposure-response curve of Sadiq MW et al., <i>Journal of pharmaceutical sciences 102(9):3320–3331</i> 2013 (<a href=\"https://doi.org/10.1002/jps.23492\">doi:10.1002/jps.23492</a>) — tail-flick latency [s] against unbound oxymorphone ng/mL — obtained by sweeping the driver instead of simulating a dose. Model family: emax.</p><h4>The parameters, in the paper's terms</h4><pre>  E0    =       5.27 s        drug-free response (baseline) (Baseline effect, Q324)
  Emax  =       55.1 s        maximal effect term (E max, Q320)
  EC50  =       62.6 ng/mL    exposure at half of the maximal effect term (EC 50, Q321)
  gamma = (library default) Hill coefficient</pre><p>The algebra is <a href=\"modelica://Pharmacolibrary.Pharmacodynamic.SigmoidEmaxSweep\">SigmoidEmaxSweep</a>; this model only supplies the numbers. The x axis is one ng/mL of unbound oxymorphone per second of simulated time (exposure is in kg/m3): there is no state, no dose and no kinetics — plot <code>response</code> against <code>exposure</code> (or <code>time</code>).</p><h4>What it reproduces</h4><pre>  exposure = 0         response 5.27   (drug-free)
  exposure = EC50 (62.6 ng/mL)  response 32.82
  exposure -> infinity  response 60.37</pre></body></html>", revisions = "<html><body><ul><li>11/2026 generated by pharmacolibrary-dev export.pharmacolibrary_models from Sadiq_2013: parameters extracted from the paper by the pharmacolibrary-dev pipeline, model built by its engineer, reviewed: accepted with caveats</li></ul></body></html>"));
end Oxymorphone_Sadiq2013_PD_tfl;
